---
description: Commit and track completed agent changes while keeping tests private
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the repository-root AGENTS.md for every project change. The owner has
provided standing authorization to verify, commit, and push completed agent
work. Preserve unrelated changes, keep tests and evidence ignored and unindexed,
use descriptive commits, and verify upstream tracking after pushing. Do not
force-push, rewrite history, publish tests, or create releases automatically.
